# Build context for `make build-archie-gateway` is docker/ (the dispatcher image COPYs from
# clawdbot/ as well as slack-dispatcher/). Until this file existed, that context was ~1.2GB —
# every package's installed node_modules was uploaded to the daemon on every build, and nothing
# in the Dockerfile ever COPYs one: every stage runs its own npm install.
#
# `**/node_modules` (not `node_modules/`) — .dockerignore patterns are NOT recursive by default,
# so the bare form would only match the top-level directory.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.DS_Store
**/.vite
